@startuml
title Text and image layers (draft): add a title, see it, export it

actor User
participant "Library (Text tab)" as Library
participant TimelineEditor
participant TimelineView
participant "BuildScene" as Scene
participant ILayerRasterizer
participant ISceneRenderer

User -> Library : drag "Title" onto a video track (or click Add text)
Library -> TimelineEditor : AddText(track, start, style)
TimelineEditor -> TimelineEditor : one undoable command, clip selected
TimelineEditor --> TimelineView : TimelineChanged
TimelineView --> User : a text bar on the track (T icon, its own colour)
User -> TimelineView : select the bar
note right: same path as any selection:\nfacets Text | Picture | Fades | Effects\nopen the Text, Picture, Fades, Effects tabs

== every frame (preview and export) ==
Scene -> Scene : for each clip active at t on a video track
alt VideoClip
  Scene -> Scene : decode the frame
else TextClip or ImageClip
  Scene -> ILayerRasterizer : Rasterize(clip, w, h, t)
  ILayerRasterizer --> Scene : premultiplied BGRA frame (cached)
end
Scene --> ISceneRenderer : RenderSource(Frame, HasAlpha, effects, crop)
ISceneRenderer --> User : layer drawn "over" what is below it
@enduml
